    {
      "id": "dc04facffd88-00021",
      "kind": "text",
      "start": null,
      "end": null,
      "page": 2,
      "section": null,
      "text": "Peak Finder"
    },
    {
      "id": "dc04facffd88-00022",
      "kind": "text",
      "start": null,
      "end": null,
      "page": 2,
      "section": null,
      "text": "One-dimensional Version"
    },
    {
      "id": "dc04facffd88-00023",
      "kind": "text",
      "start": null,
      "end": null,
      "page": 2,
      "section": null,
      "text": "Position 2 is a peak if and only if b ≥ a and b ≥ c. Position 9 is a peak if i ≥ h."
    },
    {
      "id": "dc04facffd88-00024",
      "kind": "text",
      "start": null,
      "end": null,
      "page": 2,
      "section": null,
      "text": "1 2 3 4 5 6 7 8 9"
    },
    {
      "id": "dc04facffd88-00025",
      "kind": "text",
      "start": null,
      "end": null,
      "page": 2,
      "section": null,
      "text": "g f i b a c d e h"
    },
    {
      "id": "dc04facffd88-00026",
      "kind": "text",
      "start": null,
      "end": null,
      "page": 2,
      "section": null,
      "text": "Figure 1: a-i are numbers"
    },
    {
      "id": "dc04facffd88-00027",
      "kind": "text",
      "start": null,
      "end": null,
      "page": 2,
      "section": null,
      "text": "Problem: Find a peak if it exists (Does it always exist?)"
    },
    {
      "id": "dc04facffd88-00028",
      "kind": "text",
      "start": null,
      "end": null,
      "page": 2,
      "section": null,
      "text": "Straightforward Algorithm"
    },
    {
      "id": "dc04facffd88-00029",
      "kind": "text",
      "start": null,
      "end": null,
      "page": 2,
      "section": null,
      "text": "4 1 7 4 3 2 5 6"
    },
    {
      "id": "dc04facffd88-00030",
      "kind": "text",
      "start": null,
      "end": null,
      "page": 2,
      "section": null,
      "text": "Start from left"
    },
    {
      "id": "dc04facffd88-00031",
      "kind": "text",
      "start": null,
      "end": null,
      "page": 2,
      "section": null,
      "text": ". . ."
    },
    {
      "id": "dc04facffd88-00032",
      "kind": "text",
      "start": null,
      "end": null,
      "page": 2,
      "section": null,
      "text": "1 2 . . . n/2 n-1 n"
    },
    {
      "id": "dc04facffd88-00033",
      "kind": "text",
      "start": null,
      "end": null,
      "page": 2,
      "section": null,
      "text": "might be peak"
    },
    {
      "id": "dc04facffd88-00034",
      "kind": "text",
      "start": null,
      "end": null,
      "page": 2,
      "section": null,
      "text": "θ(n) complexity worst case"
    },
    {
      "id": "dc04facffd88-00035",
      "kind": "text",
      "start": null,
      "end": null,
      "page": 2,
      "section": null,
      "text": "Figure 2: Look at n/2 elements on average, could look at n elements in the worst case"
    },
    {
      "id": "dc04facffd88-00036",
      "kind": "text",
      "start": null,
      "end": null,
      "page": 2,
      "section": null,
      "text": "What if we start in the middle? For the conﬁguration below, we would look at n/2 elements. Would we have to ever look at more than n/2 elements if we start in the middle, and choose a direction based on which neighboring element is larger that the middle element?"
    },
    {
      "id": "dc04facffd88-00037",
      "kind": "text",
      "start": null,
      "end": null,
      "page": 2,
      "section": null,
      "text": "n/2"
    },
    {
      "id": "dc04facffd88-00038",
      "kind": "text",
      "start": null,
      "end": null,
      "page": 3,
      "section": null,
      "text": "Can we do better?"
    },
    {
      "id": "dc04facffd88-00039",
      "kind": "text",
      "start": null,
      "end": null,
      "page": 3,
      "section": null,
      "text": ". . . n/2 -1 n/2 +1"
    },
    {
      "id": "dc04facffd88-00040",
      "kind": "text",
      "start": null,
      "end": null,
      "page": 3,
      "section": null,
      "text": "1 2 . . . n/2 n-1 n"
    },
    {
      "id": "dc04facffd88-00041",
      "kind": "text",
      "start": null,
      "end": null,
      "page": 3,
      "section": null,
      "text": "look at n/2 position"
    },
    {
      "id": "dc04facffd88-00042",
      "kind": "text",
      "start": null,
      "end": null,
      "page": 3,
      "section": null,
      "text": "Figure 3: Divide & Conquer"
    },
    {
      "id": "dc04facffd88-00043",
      "kind": "text",
      "start": null,
      "end": null,
      "page": 3,
      "section": null,
      "text": "• If a[n/2] < a[n/2 − 1] then only look at left half 1 . . . n/2 −−− 1 to look for peak"
    },
    {
      "id": "dc04facffd88-00044",
      "kind": "text",
      "start": null,
      "end": null,
      "page": 3,
      "section": null,
      "text": "• Else if a[n/2] < a[n/2 + 1] then only look at right half n/2 + 1 . . . n to look for peak"
    },
    {
      "id": "dc04facffd88-00045",
      "kind": "text",
      "start": null,
      "end": null,
      "page": 3,
      "section": null,
      "text": "• Else n/2 position is a peak: WHY?"
    },
    {
      "id": "dc04facffd88-00046",
      "kind": "text",
      "start": null,
      "end": null,
      "page": 3,
      "section": null,
      "text": "a[n/2] ≥ a[n/2 − 1]"
    },
    {
      "id": "dc04facffd88-00047",
      "kind": "text",
      "start": null,
      "end": null,
      "page": 3,
      "section": null,
      "text": "a[n/2] ≥ a[n/2 + 1]"
    },
    {
      "id": "dc04facffd88-00048",
      "kind": "text",
      "start": null,
      "end": null,
      "page": 3,
      "section": null,
      "text": "What is the complexity?"
    },
    {
      "id": "dc04facffd88-00049",
      "kind": "text",
      "start": null,
      "end": null,
      "page": 3,
      "section": null,
      "text": "T (n) = T (n/2) + Θ(1) = Θ(1) + . . . + Θ(1) (log2(n) times) = Θ(log2(n)) '-v \" to compare a[n/2] to neighbors"
    },
    {
      "id": "dc04facffd88-00050",
      "kind": "text",
      "start": null,
      "end": null,
      "page": 3,
      "section": null,
      "text": "In order to sum up the Θ(i)‘s as we do here, we need to ﬁnd a constant that works for all. If n = 1000000, Θ(n) algo needs 13 sec in python. If algo is Θ(log n) we only need 0.001 sec. Argue that the algorithm is correct."
    },
    {
      "id": "dc04facffd88-00051",
      "kind": "text",
      "start": null,
      "end": null,
      "page": 3,
      "section": null,
      "text": "Two-dimensional Version"
    },
    {
      "id": "dc04facffd88-00052",
      "kind": "text",
      "start": null,
      "end": null,
      "page": 3,
      "section": null,
      "text": "b a"
    },
    {
      "id": "dc04facffd88-00053",
      "kind": "text",
      "start": null,
      "end": null,
      "page": 3,
      "section": null,
      "text": "d n rows"
    },
    {
      "id": "dc04facffd88-00054",
      "kind": "text",
      "start": null,
      "end": null,
      "page": 3,
      "section": null,
      "text": "m columns"
    },
    {
      "id": "dc04facffd88-00055",
      "kind": "text",
      "start": null,
      "end": null,
      "page": 3,
      "section": null,
      "text": "Figure 4: Greedy Ascent Algorithm: Θ(nm) complexity, Θ(n 2) algorithm if m = n"
    },
    {
      "id": "dc04facffd88-00056",
      "kind": "text",
      "start": null,
      "end": null,
      "page": 3,
      "section": null,
      "text": "a is a 2D-peak iﬀ a ≥ b, a ≥ d, a ≥ c, a ≥ e"
    },
    {
      "id": "dc04facffd88-00057",
      "kind": "text",
      "start": null,
      "end": null,
      "page": 4,
      "section": null,
      "text": "14 13 12"
    },
    {
      "id": "dc04facffd88-00058",
      "kind": "text",
      "start": null,
      "end": null,
      "page": 4,
      "section": null,
      "text": "9 11 17"
    },
    {
      "id": "dc04facffd88-00059",
      "kind": "text",
      "start": null,
      "end": null,
      "page": 4,
      "section": null,
      "text": "17 19 20"
    },
    {
      "id": "dc04facffd88-00060",
      "kind": "text",
      "start": null,
      "end": null,
      "page": 4,
      "section": null,
      "text": "Figure 5: Circled value is peak."
    },
    {
      "id": "dc04facffd88-00061",
      "kind": "text",
      "start": null,
      "end": null,
      "page": 4,
      "section": null,
      "text": "Attempt # 1: Extend 1D Divide and Conquer to 2D"
    },
    {
      "id": "dc04facffd88-00062",
      "kind": "text",
      "start": null,
      "end": null,
      "page": 4,
      "section": null,
      "text": "j = m/2"
    },
    {
      "id": "dc04facffd88-00063",
      "kind": "text",
      "start": null,
      "end": null,
      "page": 4,
      "section": null,
      "text": "• Pick middle column j = m/2."
    },
    {
      "id": "dc04facffd88-00064",
      "kind": "text",
      "start": null,
      "end": null,
      "page": 4,
      "section": null,
      "text": "• Find a 1D-peak at i, j."
    },
    {
      "id": "dc04facffd88-00065",
      "kind": "text",
      "start": null,
      "end": null,
      "page": 4,
      "section": null,
      "text": "• Use (i, j) as a start point on row i to ﬁnd 1D-peak on row i."
    },
    {
      "id": "dc04facffd88-00066",
      "kind": "text",
      "start": null,
      "end": null,
      "page": 4,
      "section": null,
      "text": "Attempt #1 fails"
    },
    {
      "id": "dc04facffd88-00067",
      "kind": "text",
      "start": null,
      "end": null,
      "page": 4,
      "section": null,
      "text": "Problem: 2D-peak may not exist on row i"
    },
    {
      "id": "dc04facffd88-00068",
      "kind": "text",
      "start": null,
      "end": null,
      "page": 4,
      "section": null,
      "text": "14 13 12"
    },
    {
      "id": "dc04facffd88-00069",
      "kind": "text",
      "start": null,
      "end": null,
      "page": 4,
      "section": null,
      "text": "9 11"
    },
    {
      "id": "dc04facffd88-00070",
      "kind": "text",
      "start": null,
      "end": null,
      "page": 4,
      "section": null,
      "text": "17 19 20"
    },
    {
      "id": "dc04facffd88-00071",
      "kind": "text",
      "start": null,
      "end": null,
      "page": 4,
      "section": null,
      "text": "End up with 14 which is not a 2D-peak."
    },
    {
      "id": "dc04facffd88-00072",
      "kind": "text",
      "start": null,
      "end": null,
      "page": 5,
      "section": null,
      "text": "Attempt # 2"
    },
    {
      "id": "dc04facffd88-00073",
      "kind": "text",
      "start": null,
      "end": null,
      "page": 5,
      "section": null,
      "text": "• Pick middle column j = m/2"
    },
    {
      "id": "dc04facffd88-00074",
      "kind": "text",
      "start": null,
      "end": null,
      "page": 5,
      "section": null,
      "text": "• Find global maximum on column j at (i, j)"
    },
    {
      "id": "dc04facffd88-00075",
      "kind": "text",
      "start": null,
      "end": null,
      "page": 5,
      "section": null,
      "text": "• Compare (i, j − 1), (i, j), (i, j + 1)"
    },
    {
      "id": "dc04facffd88-00076",
      "kind": "text",
      "start": null,
      "end": null,
      "page": 5,
      "section": null,
      "text": "• Pick left columns of (i, j − 1) > (i, j)"
    },
    {
      "id": "dc04facffd88-00077",
      "kind": "text",
      "start": null,
      "end": null,
      "page": 5,
      "section": null,
      "text": "• Similarly for right"
    },
    {
      "id": "dc04facffd88-00078",
      "kind": "text",
      "start": null,
      "end": null,
      "page": 5,
      "section": null,
      "text": "• (i, j) is a 2D-peak if neither condition holds ← WHY?"
    },
    {
      "id": "dc04facffd88-00079",
      "kind": "text",
      "start": null,
      "end": null,
      "page": 5,
      "section": null,
      "text": "• Solve the new problem with half the number of columns."
    },
    {
      "id": "dc04facffd88-00080",
      "kind": "text",
      "start": null,
      "end": null,
      "page": 5,
      "section": null,
      "text": "• When you have a single column, ﬁnd global maximum and you‘re done."
    },
    {
      "id": "dc04facffd88-00081",
      "kind": "text",
      "start": null,
      "end": null,
      "page": 5,
      "section": null,
      "text": "Example of Attempt #2"
    },
    {
      "id": "dc04facffd88-00082",
      "kind": "text",
      "start": null,
      "end": null,
      "page": 5,
      "section": null,
      "text": "go with"
    },
    {
