      "text": "Complexity of Attempt #2"
    },
    {
      "id": "dc04facffd88-00094",
      "kind": "text",
      "start": null,
      "end": null,
      "page": 5,
      "section": null,
      "text": "If T (n, m) denotes work required to solve problem with n rows and m columns"
    },
    {
      "id": "dc04facffd88-00095",
      "kind": "text",
      "start": null,
      "end": null,
      "page": 5,
      "section": null,
      "text": "T (n, m) = T (n, m/2) + Θ(n) (to ﬁnd global maximum on a column — (n rows))"
    },
    {
      "id": "dc04facffd88-00096",
      "kind": "text",
      "start": null,
      "end": null,
      "page": 5,
      "section": null,
      "text": "T (n, m) = Θ(n) + . . . + Θ(n) ' -v \" log m = Θ(n log m) = Θ(n log n) if m = n"
    },
